 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Many drew accounts of fulfilled things",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Held by eyes that saw from the start",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 3.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I searched deep for truth and proof",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 3.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To write an orderly report",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 2.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Most excellent Theophilus hear",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 2.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Know the certainty of what you learned",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From the start to the finish clear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The word is sure and firmly stirred",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "My first book told what He began",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 2.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To do and teach in the land",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then He gave instructions by the Spirit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To chosen ones who waited",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
